# Copy to .env.local to override the defaults for a local `npm run dev`.
# Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed variables to the bundle.

# Origin of the backend. Unset, the client talks to <this host>:8080, which is
# what `./build.sh up` starts — so for the standard local setup you need nothing
# here at all.
#
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8080
#
# On Render this is set on the static site by render.yaml, pointing at the
# backend Web Service.
#
# An empty value means same-origin: use it when a reverse proxy serves the
# static files and the API under one host.
#
# VITE_API_BASE=
